{\an8}<i>in downtown Lincoln.</i>

1262
01:30:51,209 --> 01:30:54,293
<i>The attorney general is conducting
a thorough investigation</i>

1263
01:30:54,293 --> 01:30:55,918
<i>into the K9 program</i>

1264
01:30:55,918 --> 01:31:00,043
<i>and said she believes
the corruption runs even deeper.</i>

1265
01:31:00,543 --> 01:31:03,584
<i>In an effort to help
those impacted by this crime,</i>

1266
01:31:03,584 --> 01:31:06,293
<i>city council is expected to pass a bill</i>

1267
01:31:06,293 --> 01:31:10,043
<i>which will release millions of dollars
into the Monument Hill community</i>

1268
01:31:10,043 --> 01:31:13,626
<i>and restrict the use of police robotics
in the neighborhood.</i>

1269
01:31:14,126 --> 01:31:17,959
<i>Critics of this bill
are pointing to recent reports</i>

1270
01:31:17,959 --> 01:31:20,876
<i>of an increase of Psyke
flowing into Lincoln City</i>

1271
01:31:20,876 --> 01:31:22,709
<i>from an unknown source.</i>

1272
01:31:23,459 --> 01:31:27,168
<i>Reporting live outside the courthouse,
it's back inside to the newsroom.</i>

1273
01:31:28,168 --> 01:31:30,626
[suspenseful music playing]

